<newsitem itemid="92342" id="root" date="1996-10-02" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Blenheim reports record 1st half profit.</title>
<headline>Blenheim reports record 1st half profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.1		   vs 8.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.675		  vs 3.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     30.7		   vs 15.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   102.8		  vs 92.1</p>
<p>NOTE- Blenheim Group said the comparative pre-tax figure is before exceptional items.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 33.3		   vs 17.8</p>
<p> Exceptional		nil		    vs 2.1 loss</p>
<p> Interest (payable)     2.6		    vs 2.6</p>
<p> Tax			  10.8		   vs 4.6</p>
<p> Net taxed		  19.9		   vs 8.5</p>
<p> Retained		   13.4		   vs 2.4</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 15, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Dec 10</p>
<p>Note- Exhibitions group and publisher Blenheim Group Plc said a &quot;further announcement&quot; will be made when appropriate on a possible offer for the group from an unnamed suitor.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
